{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q1", "domain": "unknown", "question": "以下哪项描述符合命主的出身情况？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字进行分析，日主己土生于申月，金旺泄土，身偏弱。年柱庚申干支一气伤官，为忌神，且伤官旺而泄身，代表祖上根基不厚，家境助力有限。月柱甲申，正官坐伤官，官星被截脚，又见年干庚金伤官克官，表明父亲事业易受阻，难有突出成就。八字金多水少，财星壬水虽透时干，但无强根，且远在时柱，不显于早年。幸日支巳火正印为用，能暖局生身，母亲关爱有加，使家庭可维持基本温饱，不至于一贫如洗，但伤官过重，财源不聚，整体出身趋于普通，难有丰厚盈余。因此符合 B 项描述。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q1", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 15589, "response_id": "a0992e07-2ad0-49e4-bab4-7f8f072e41a5", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 251, "completion_tokens": 871, "total_tokens": 1122, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 678}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 123}}
{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q2", "domain": "study", "question": "以下哪项描述符合命主的学历情况？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析，日主己土生于申月，金旺泄土，身弱。印星为学历象征，日支巳火正印被申金合克，且巳申合化水，印星受损，根基不深。年柱伤官庚申强旺，月干正官甲木坐申受制，官伤相战，早年学业易有波折。但命主15-25岁行壬午大运，午火偏印得力，生扶日主，利于求学考试，补足原局印弱之憾，可取得较高学历。综合判断，具有大学程度学历最为可能。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q2", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 17729, "response_id": "52b7ca7a-6ff8-4f96-bf00-c36075d7868c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 220, "completion_tokens": 1014, "total_tokens": 1234, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 870}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 92}}
{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q3", "domain": "career", "question": "以下哪项描述符合命主的配偶工作状况？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n1. **定夫星与配偶宫**  \n   日主为己土（阴土），女命以正官为夫星。月干甲木为正官，故甲木代表配偶。日支巳火为配偶宫，代表配偶的家居环境与内在状态。\n\n2. **夫星状况**  \n   - 甲木坐申金（月支申金），申为甲木绝地，甲木受克严重，根气虚弱。  \n   - 年柱庚申，庚金伤官高透，克制甲木官星，形成“伤官见官”，对婚姻和夫星有不利影响。  \n   - 时干壬水为偏财，自坐申金长生，财星有力。壬水可通关庚金与甲木的冲克，形成“伤官生财，财生官”的流转，使夫星虽弱而有救。  \n   - 整体来说，夫星弱而有生扶，代表配偶非大富大贵之格，但有一定事业根基；官星受制不易掌重权，但财星流转暗示其有稳定收入或专业能力。\n\n3. **配偶宫状况**  \n   - 日支巳火为正印，为日主喜用（己土身弱，需火土生扶），代表配偶品性温良，能在精神、生活上给予助力。  \n   - 巳火与月、时、年支申金相合，巳申合水（财），虽增强财意，但也减弱印星之力，表示配偶助力并非极其宏大，但仍有正面作用。  \n   - 印星为文职、稳定类型，配合夫星官气，倾向受薪工作而非高风险经商。\n\n4. **全局结构与职业倾向**  \n   - 金旺木衰，伤官过强，不利创业经商，若经商易受波折。但有壬水财星通关，宜以技艺、管理、金融等受薪领域求财。  \n   - 甲木官星得财生，主配偶能得中等职位，但伤官根重，官星无强根，难以到达极高阶主管。  \n   - 配偶宫为喜用，且夫星有救应，故配偶对家庭有实际助力，不会是毫无帮助或负债拖累的情况。  \n   - 综合来看，配偶为打工一族，从事专业技术或管理层副职，收入中上，对家庭有正面贡献，符合选项B特征。\n\n### 最终答案  \nB", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q3", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 34072, "response_id": "cc638050-e25a-4e6e-a95c-0d51319f7921", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 265, "completion_tokens": 1873, "total_tokens": 2138, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens":