{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q4", "domain": "unknown", "question": "以下哪项描述符合命主的子息状况？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n女命以食伤为子女星：食神（辛）为女，伤官（庚）为子。原局年柱庚申、月支申、时支申，伤官庚金极旺，且时柱壬申，子女宫坐伤官，主有子之象。日主己土生于申月，金多泄身，需火土扶助。起运约5岁8个月，逆排大运：癸未、**壬午（15-25岁）**、**辛巳（25-35岁）**、庚辰。\n\n- **2004甲申年**：命主24岁，行壬午大运末。流年甲申，天干甲木正官，与年干庚金冲克（伤官见官），地支申金伏吟年、月、时柱，虽引动子女宫，但伏吟加重金木交战，夫星严重受克，多主波折，得子希望渺茫。\n- **2010庚寅年**：命主30岁，入辛巳大运（火土喜用）。流年庚寅，天干庚伤官（子星）透出，地支寅木冲动时柱子女宫申金（寅申冲），恰逢子星直接作用在子女宫，冲则动，产育信号极为强烈。且该年与大运、命局构成“寅巳申”三刑，刑主动荡与割裂，常应剖腹产或手术生子，符合现代生育特征。大运辛食神虽透，但流年庚伤官主事，综合断之一子诞于此年。\n\n### 最终答案\nD", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q4", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 124762, "response_id": "fcf1bb0e-8eac-4afe-a640-f1c95513631d", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 236, "completion_tokens": 6981, "total_tokens": 7217, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 6615}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 108}}
{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", "domain": "relationship", "question": "在2022壬寅年，以下哪项是命主的婚姻经历？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字原局与岁运分析：\n\n日主己土生于申月，四柱地支三申，金气极旺。月干甲木正官为夫星，坐申金绝地，又被年干庚金伤官冲克，夫星衰微，婚姻先天不稳。日主自身伤官过旺，对丈夫挑剔不满，且日支妻宫巳火被合化为忌，易有感情出轨倾向。\n\n大运庚辰（2016-2026年），庚金伤官透出，加重原局伤官克官之势，此运婚姻危机加深，命主易生外心。2022壬寅年，流年与命局构成寅巳申三刑，刑入妻宫巳火，主婚变冲突。寅木为夫星甲木之根，看似夫星得助，实则被原局三申冲克，夫星根基尽损。天干壬水财星引动，可视为外遇之事暴露。伤官极旺冲克官星，兼三刑肆虐，毫无和缓之象，足见矛盾爆发后难以挽回，必然导致离婚。\n\n因此，此年应验为命主外遇被丈夫发现，未获原谅，当年离婚。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 52526, "response_id": "34364d28-e0e9-451a-8ccf-a6965f7c988a", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 294, "completion_tokens": 3022, "total_tokens": 3316, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2749}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 38}}
{"case_id": "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q6", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的性格和情绪？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n命主的八字为：辛亥 辛丑 戊戌 丁巳。\n日主戊土，生于丑月得令，地支戌土为强根，时柱丁巳印星生身，日主明显身强。\n天干透出双辛金伤官，泄秀有力，代表命主聪慧、有才华。月柱辛金坐丑土金库，伤官强旺，但时干丁火正印紧贴克制辛金，形成“伤官佩印”的结构，使得伤官的傲气与任性得到化解，化为内敛、儒雅的才智。\n地支巳丑暗合金局加强金的力量，但巳火为印星，内藏丙火，亦能调候；戌土为火库，内藏丁火，整个格局土金相生，火土厚重，性格中带有稳定、包容的特质，同时印星高透，注重精神生活，好学习、爱思考。\n伤官双透，本主言辞锋利，但得印星制约，外在表现温文尔雅，善于交际而不锋芒毕露；独处时因有印星滋养内心，自得其乐，精神世界丰富。\n综合来看，命主并非孤僻寡言之人（不符A），也无明显暴力倾向（不符B），C选项提及“爱蟋蟀”缺乏八字依据，且“蟋蟀书画”较为偏狭，不如D选项概括全面。D选项“乐于交际，独处时又自得其乐”最为契合伤官佩印、身强得泄的命理特征。\n\n### 最终答案\nD", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q6", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 15605, "response_id": "9e1ad546-5c8b-4d5b-95aa-e33a8ce0838d", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 243, "completion_tokens": 831, "total_tokens": 1074, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 485}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 115}}
{"case_id": "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q7", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主的男女关系和婚姻情况？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "命主为戊土日主，生于丑月，土旺得令。原局双辛伤官透干，时柱丁巳印星，伤官佩印。婚姻方面，男命以财星（水）为妻，原局财星仅藏于月支丑中癸水，且被旺土围攻、辛金伤官泄耗，财星衰弱，妻缘薄弱。日支夫妻宫为戌土比肩，与月支丑土相刑，刑入妻宫，主婚姻关系不睦，易生嫌隙。\n\n大运排盘：阴年男逆排，起运约1岁。虚岁2—11行庚子运，12—21行己亥运，22—31行戊戌运，32—41行丁酉运，42—51行丙申运等。\n\n虚岁24至33期间（约1995—2004年），正行戊戌大运。大运戊土比肩透干，与日主争财；运支戌土伏吟夫妻宫，加剧丑戌刑，妻星癸水被刑克严重。此运比肩势众，财星受迫，虽非佳运，但逢财星透出之流年（如1996丙子年、2002壬午年等），子水财星现，午火生土亦合戌，或有婚缘。因妻星受刑伤，故妻子易情绪失控、敏感多思，伤官又主口舌，因此感情容易受影响，符合“因妻子过于情绪化，而影响了感情”之象。其后进入丁酉运，金旺克财，若已婚，妻将更危，但选项C已涵盖其婚姻起始情况。\n\n综上，命主最可能于戊戌运（24—33岁间）成婚，但婚姻受害于妻宫刑伤及伤官之性。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q7", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 83698, "response_id": "faf2f7ed-ec23-40de-bb84-5bc492dfd8ad", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 252, "completion_tokens": 4697, "total_tokens": 4949, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 4285}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 124}}
